WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Singing Voice that Awakens Miracles

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Evolve, Lilamon

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.880
The Singing Voice that Awakens Miracles!

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.550
Evolve, Lilamon!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.130
Yoshino!

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.560
Open the door!

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.700
Come home with mother.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.730
No!

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.280
Leave me alone!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.480
I hate you and my sisters!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.010
I hate everyone!

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.170
Yoshino, are you okay?

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.820
Yeah, it's nothing.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.340
I just had a bad dream.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.840
There's still some time before the sun comes up.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.310
You should rest for a little longer.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.370
I'm fine.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.610
See, look...

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.980
I'm feeling better already.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.940
Aniki, I can't eat anymore...

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.180
I wonder how much farther we have to go...

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.110
If we keep up our pace,

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:26.580
we should reach Mercurimon's dwelling at Infinity Ice Ridge by tomorrow night.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.290
There's no way to get back without fighting, right?

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.570
Which is why we should maintain our health.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.390
Yeah.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:51.440
I hear it.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:56.520
The heartbeats of those filthy humans who wish to attack me.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.310
Heartbeats filled with hatred!

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:01.350
I will stop those heartbeats!

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.160
Let's go, Falcomon!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:07.460
What?

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.090
What? Falcomon gave the vaccine to the humans?!

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:13.620
It's all Ikuto's fault.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:18.590
It must be because he grew up with Ikuto that it's caused him to side with humans so easily!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:23.260
Traitors must... must be dealt with right away!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.430
Really, Agumon!

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.180
Walk a little faster!

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.950
My legs hurt... Let me rest for a while...

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.340
This is why we told you to go on a diet!

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.450
If we waste any more time, it'll be dark soon.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:50.580
But we've been walking since morning...

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.540
And I'm hungry...

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.390
We don't have a choice. Let's rest for a bit.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.590
We can't!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.950
W-Why not?

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:00.060
There's no place we can hide here, see?

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.010
What would happen if we were attacked by enemies?

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:06.890
Oh... I see.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:07.720
That's true...

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.490
Hard to believe that you actually think about these things.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.110
Of course I do.

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.190
From now on, you have to listen to <i>my</i>  orders as the leader.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.070
Got that?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.290
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.960
As long as that's clear.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.330
That's how it is.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.660
W-When did Yoshino become our leader?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.910
Well, at least...

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:31.490
One thing we know for sure is that it was never you.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:32.370
What?!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:44.970
Ikuto!

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.550
Not let you pass from here!

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.360
Let's see if you can stop me!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.240
Falcomon!

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:58.870
Falcomon, evolve!

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:16.610
Peckmon!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.460
Let's go!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.010
Baby Flame!

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.040
Aniki, are you okay?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.390
Kunai Bane!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.900
You suck! Where do you think you're aiming?

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.280
Yoshino! Let's evolve, too!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.340
Hurry and charge your Digisoul!

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:00.630
This... this chance is too good.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.590
All right Mammon, it's your turn!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:20.270
Mammon

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:20.270
Perfect Level

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:11.990
Mammon.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:17.140
A Perfect Level Digimon who can sense events and hear sounds that occur from far away.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:20.270
His special attacks are Tusk Strike and Tundra Breath!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.780
Destroy every last one of those filthy humans!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:31.530
That voice is...

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.540
Ikuto, what's wrong?

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.810
Yoshino-san, hurry!

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.080
Master!

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.110
No good, we can't find them at all!

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:15.390
We've scanned all the areas around the dropoff point, but still can't find any signals...

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:20.550
Could Masaru and the rest have been... eaten by a Digimon?!

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.790
Don't say such foolish things!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.030
Clean up the data again.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.380
Don't let even one small signal escape your attention!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:27.760
Yes, sir!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:27.760
Yes, sir!

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.090
I suppose it really comes down to my having to go there...

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.560
You seem troubled.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.670
It's you!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.340
Aniki! It's okay now.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.640
Damn, what bad luck.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.520
Wonder what happened to everyone.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:57.850
You don't think they went under, do you?

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.960
Oh, found one!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:00.850
It's Gaomon!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.790
Hey! Gaomon!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.150
Master...

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.160
What happened to Tohma?

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.690
Where are Yoshino and Lalamon?

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.420
No way!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.330
Tohma!

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.210
Yoshino!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.240
Where are you?!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.840
Lalamon!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.770
Damn it...

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.470
Let's go, Agumon!

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:24.130
To where?

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.570
You have to ask?

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:28.000
We're going down to save them!

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:35.270
Human...

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:35.930
Not forgive!

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.960
Man, he really bothers you to no end!

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.500
What should we do, Aniki?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.460
We don't have a choice.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.210
Gaomon!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.650
Agumon and I will deal with these guys.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.540
You go save Tohma and the others!

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.110
Yes!

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:02.040
I'm your opponent!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.050
My sisters... They're so good.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.890
You'll soon be able to play very well, Yoshino!

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:51.110
You have a lot of talent.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.070
But... I...

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:12.540
Contestant number sixteen, Fujieda Yoshino-san.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.860
She will be performing "The Puppy Waltz."

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.890
All right, it's your turn.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:19.020
Good luck!

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.300
Yoshino?

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.580
Yoshino?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.500
Hang in there, Yoshino!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.170
Hang in there, Yoshino!

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:30.960
Yoshino!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.040
Wake up!

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.500
Yoshino!

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:37.670
Lalamon?

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:39.280
You're awake!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.570
Thank goodness...

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.410
What happened...?

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.420
We were swept down by the avalanche.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.600
Where are Tohma and Masaru...?

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:47.560
Tohma!

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.360
Tohma, are you all right?

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.000
Yeah, it's nothing big.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:52.770
I'm just a bit...

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:57.240
When we fell, he was protecting you. That's why...

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.040
Tohma...

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.140
Can you pull me up?

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:03.200
This avalanche could have been triggered by the enemy.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.030
That will mean they'll come here to attack us again.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.290
I wonder what happened to Masaru and the others...

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.330
They could have been swept by the avalanche, too.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.330
Lalamon, what's wrong?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.040
Something's coming.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.990
That's strange...

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.550
They should have fallen around here.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.050
Go and search for them!

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:37.050
We can't go back to Mercurimon-sama without finding them!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.700
Are they also Mercurimon's minions?

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:46.310
At this rate, we'll be discovered soon enough.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:49.950
We have to defeat them and meet up with the others again somehow...

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.400
No way!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.580
We can't beat those guys!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.950
What's wrong with you, Yoshino?

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:59.050
You're a brave member of DATS, remember?

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.930
Get a hold of yourself!

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:04.930
I'm just a rubbish member who only drags everyone down.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:05.590
Yoshino...

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.500
I've always felt that way...

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.260
Whenever the enemies they fought got stronger...

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:16.390
Masaru and Tohma would always face them without a flinch.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.940
But I can't... I can't keep up with everyone!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.670
That's not true, Yoshino-san!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.090
We know you're doing your best!

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.910
Do you mean... that you're bothered by the fact that I haven't evolved to my Perfect form yet?

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.890
It's all right!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:35.870
You'll definitely find a way to make me evolve to Perfect.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.140
After all, you're very talented!

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:40.210
Right, Tohma?

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:40.800
Stop it!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:42.730
Yoshino...

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:46.460
I... don't have any talent at all...

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.310
Even when I was young...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.740
My sisters were always so good...

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:00.150
but I always failed at the most critical moments...

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.980
I don't have any talent at all!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.810
Oh no! We've been discovered!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.780
How long did you think you could hide?

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.010
There's no place to run!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.620
Yoshino?

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.370
I can't take much more of this!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.560
I'm going!

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:28.970
Lalamon!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:33.390
Digimon who team up with humans should be destroyed!

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.090
Mammon, we've found them.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:37.940
Go crazy...

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.150
Go crazy as much as you want!

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.750
Rolling...

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.120
Upper!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:07.910
Damn it...

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.050
Gaomon, leave this one to me!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:12.300
Go protect Tohma and Yoshino!

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.010
You can't do this alone!

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:14.890
It's okay!

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.000
I'm a member of DATS, too.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.190
I understand.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:26.460
Even if I can't evolve to Perfect, I won't run away!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.190
Human...

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:29.210
Not forgive!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:30.690
Why?

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.450
You're human just like me!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.690
I'm Digimon!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.410
Humans killed my mother, Yukidarumon!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:42.360
What did you say?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.020
Hate humans!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.850
I never forgive!

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.550
Cool your head down!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.990
Ikuto!

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.720
Why do we have to hate each other when we're both humans?

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.750
Ikuto, let's retreat for now!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.710
Let go of me!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.410
I must get revenge for Mom!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.100
Let go!

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.750
Humans killed his mother...?

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.680
What on earth is going on?

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:07.630
Let go!

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:08.990
Let go!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.300
Nuts Shoot!

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:23.630
I will take care of Master.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.250
Miss Yoshino, you should go and help Lalamon!

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.930
I can't fight anymore!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.150
I hate fighting!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.590
Lalamon is fighting alone...

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.550
to protect you.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:36.850
Lala Screw!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:47.700
Lalamon can't evolve, and yet she fights with everything she's got...

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:52.340
That's why you should also give your all in doing what you're capable of!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.230
Doing... what I'm capable of...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.300
I can't give up...

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.570
I have to fight for Yoshino!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.830
Sing a Song!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.110
This song!

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.960
You'll be fine!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.770
Come on, bring out your courage!

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.250
You can do it!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:30.670
Now, play the piano!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.650
Exactly the way you want to.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.970
That's right.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.050
On that day...

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.990
I played that song.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.240
I was guided by your song...

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:29.500
and it brought me to the human world.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:37.130
This lullaby is the first song I learned in the human world.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.290
I dedicate this song to Yoshino!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.300
Lalamon!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:46.640
Yoshino!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:49.410
I'm sorry!

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:50.610
I forgot!

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:55.610
Whenever things got difficult, I always had you by my side no matter what.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:56.850
Yes.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.000
But it isn't just me.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:01.140
Yoshino!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.560
Hey!

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.330
Hang on, we're coming to save you!

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:06.280
You have many friends!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:10.460
You're right.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.740
Impertinent!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.840
You are too impertinent!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.630
I can no longer allow you to go!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.860
Angry Rock!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:21.220
Mammon!

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:23.300
What are you lazing around and sleeping for?!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.770
Hurry up and destroy them!

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.870
I feel so silly for worrying on my own now.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:37.030
Let's go, Yoshino!

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:38.600
Digisoul...

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:44.140
Full Charge!

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:50.670
Lalamon, evolve!

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:02.950
<b>tada hitotsu no yakusoku ga sekai wo kaeru</b>

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:02.950
<b>Just one promise will change the world</b>

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:07.910
<b>chiisana koro miageteta hoshi no you ni</b>

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:07.910
<b>Like the stars you gazed up at when you were little</b>

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:13.640
<b>kokoro no oku de matataku hikari</b>

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:13.640
<b>The light that twinkles inside your heart</b>

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:11.870
Lilamon!

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:18.450
<b>yume to iu na no kagayaki e</b>

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:18.450
<b>Shapes into a radiance known as "dreams"</b>

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.020
Lalamon evolved!

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.390
It's not her usual evolution,

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.860
but her Perfect Level evolution!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.520
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.520
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:30.830
Lilamon

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:30.830
Perfect Level

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:22.790
Lilamon.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.810
<b>sore ga kimi no yakusoku</b>

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.810
<b>That is your promise</b>

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.580
A Perfect Level Digimon who looks like a lilac flower.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.430
Her special attacks are Lila Shower and Un Deux Pollen.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:31.080
<b>kurayami wo kirisakeru sono chikara</b>

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:31.080
